# The Delphi sources in this repo are stored with CRLF line endings (they have been
# since the SVN import). core.autocrlf=input would rewrite them to LF on the next
# `git add`, turning any one-line edit into a whole-file diff and destroying blame.
# Marking them -text tells git to store the bytes exactly as they are on disk.
*.pas  -text
*.inc  -text
*.dpr  -text
*.dof  -text
*.dpk  -text
*.res  -text
*.rc   -text
*.INC  -text

# Windows batch files MUST be CRLF or cmd.exe can mis-parse them.
*.cmd  -text
*.bat  -text

# Committed build artifacts.
*.dll  binary
*.exe  binary
*.map  -text
